# GitHub Repo Issue Comments (Comments) API
created: 2024-01-15, last updated: 2026-02-03, [Read more](https://www.apideck.com/integrations/github/repo-issue-comments)

Sync permissioned repo issue comments data with GitHub through Apideck's unified API.
One integration, instant access to the governed data your team needs.
In Apideck, this resource is called Comments (API:
`collection-ticket-comments`)
...
```
import { Apideck } from '@apideck/unify'
const apideck = new Apideck({
apiKey: process.env.APIDECK_API_KEY,
appId: 'YOUR_APP_ID',
consumerId: 'YOUR_CONSUMER_ID'
})
// List repo issue comments from GitHub
const result = await apideck.issue-tracking.collectionTicketComments.list({
serviceId: 'github'
})
for await (const page of result) {
console.log(page)
